Tool response:
Tool: enroll_customer_in_loyalty_program
Description: Enroll a customer in the loyalty program and award welcome points.
Enrolls the customer with the specified ID in the default loyalty program 
(assumed to be 'ClubStack Rewards' or the active program with lowest ID) 
and awards them the welcome points associated with that program.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "customer_id": {
          "type": "integer",
          "title": "Customer Id",
          "description": ""
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "customer_id"
      ]
    }
